// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3166431800" "Speak with... the leader of the Infected?"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3177188996" "Fascinating, they've formed their own community? Is this where the calling is happening?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P673868344" "You discovered that Longbow has a cure for the Infected - and they're trying to spread it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2454911880" "Longbow? Hrmph, they're too short-sighted to see the true miracles that we are working with the Infected. You and I cannot allow this to succeed, {HeroName}.<br><br>Longbow must be employing a telepath to control the Infected. We must find them and <i>crush</i> them, along with the cure they've created!"
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P848285707" "<color orange>The Longbow security terminal is wide open for your use, thanks to the codes you received.<br><br>You'll have to disable this to cut off communication with Fort Darwin.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2599123862" "(Disable the database)"
// Page HackedKilledHero Text :
"P3143023615" "<color orange>You disable the database, cutting off the base's access from Fort Darwin!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2119864438" "The area of Darwin's Landing is crawling with Longbow, {HeroName}. I don't believe that this telepath is hiding in their main base of <color yellow>Fort Darwin</color>.<br><br>No, they must be close, <i>very</i> close by, in order to have such an effect on the Infected in Mercy City itself."
// AcceptString :
"P2302507329" "I know the deal. Beat up Longbow, find the obvious evidence for their base."
// SendOffString :
"P3411266915" "Good to see that we're on the same page. If Longbow is this close to curing the Infected, they'll be sure to have plenty of their grunts out in force to stop any villains from finding their base.<br><br>Unfortunately, they are severely underestimating your abilities, once again. Defeating enough of them will earn us the information we need. And then, with Longbow's outpost here destroyed, the experimentation on the Infected and the people of Mercy Island can continue!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P601738002" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Proper Destiny</color>"

